-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Icon artwork
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Covers every image in assets/, the artwork embedded as data URIs in the
generated components (src/generated/ and dist/), and manifest.json's record of
it.

The images in assets/ are byte-for-byte copies of files in the EVE Online
game client. The copies inlined into the components omit text metadata chunks
(such as Adobe XMP); their pixels and colour information are unchanged.

The artwork is the property of CCP hf., which trades as Fenris Creations
(formerly CCP Games), and all rights in it are reserved. It is NOT licensed
under the MIT License, and nothing in this package grants any right to use,
copy, modify or distribute it.

It is used here under the EVE Online Developer License Agreement
(https://developers.eveonline.com/license-agreement). That agreement requires
the following notice, reproduced as written:

  © 2014 CCP hf. All rights reserved. "EVE", "EVE Online", "CCP", and all
  related logos and images are trademarks or registered trademarks of CCP hf.

The notice Fenris Creations currently publishes on https://www.eveonline.com:

  EVE Online® and Fenris Creations™ and all related logos and other elements
  are trademarks of Fenris Creations.

  © 2026 Fenris Creations. All rights reserved.

If you use this package, your right to use the artwork comes from your own
standing with CCP hf. / Fenris Creations, for example your acceptance of the
Developer License Agreement, not from this file. Keep both notices above with
any copy of the artwork.

